flowchart LR
    I[Project intent] --> R[Requirement + criterion]
    R --> D[Deliverable]
    D --> W[Work packet]
    W --> A[Agent execution]
    A --> E[Evidence]
    E --> Q[Quality gate]
    Q --> V[Review]
    V --> O{Direction needed?}
    O -->|Yes| H[Owner decision]
    H --> V
    O -->|No| P[Approve]
    V --> P
    P --> L[Learning record]
    L --> N[Backlog / change / next iteration]
